sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant UI as Web application
  participant API
  participant DB as Orders database
  User->>UI: Submit order
  UI->>API: POST /orders
  API->>DB: Insert order
  alt Order accepted
    DB-->>API: Order identifier
    API-->>UI: 201 Created
    UI-->>User: Show confirmation
  else Order rejected
    DB-->>API: Validation error
    API-->>UI: 422 Unprocessable Content
    UI-->>User: Show validation message
  end
